        <Description>The Berserker VI-X is a 10.4 million kg statement of intent. Finished in signature Volsung Slate, this heavy-armor brawler is optimized for 0.50g environments and features a triple-zone pressurized interior to ensure crew efficiency during high-intensity "market liquidations."</Description>
